# Rounded panels

Bordered cards, stat panels, empty states, and tables use `rounded-lg` with the border.

```tsx
<div className="rounded-lg border border-border px-4 py-4">
```

```tsx
<div className="overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-border">
```

Do not leave a bordered panel square.
